@startuml
title Academic Pipeline mid-entry
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Read current stable specs and status;
:Resolve route-bound mid-entry instructions;
:Present entry node, required inputs, Gates and cost;
:User confirms one parent run;
:Freeze graph slice reachable from selected entry;
if (entry node?) then (research)
  :Start at research;
elseif (write)
  :Require research_report input;
elseif (review)
  :Require manuscript_draft input;
elseif (revision / re-review)
  :Require manuscript and review roles;
elseif (format)
  :Require accepted manuscript and delivery snapshot;
else (final-integrity)
  :Require formatted manuscript;
endif
:Authorized children start without another run confirmation;
:Continue until selected slice is complete;
stop
@enduml

